    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d441">

                <pb facs="0817" n="707" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg707"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wharton to Mr.
                            Thomas.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-08-26"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 26,
                        1890</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 50.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose for your information copy of the
                    order issued by the Acting Secretary of the Navy on the 18th instant in
                    reference to the salute to the Swedish flag fired on the occasion of the
                    embarkation on the U. S. S. <hi rendition="#italic">Baltimore</hi> at New York,
                    on the 23d instant, of the remains of Captain Ericsson.</p>
                <p>The cruiser sailed on the same day, with orders to disembark the remains, as
                    requested by the Government of Sweden, at Gothenburg, where she is expected to
                    arrive about the 12th proximo.</p>
                <p>The Department desires you to be present at Gothenburg on her arrival.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William F. Wharton</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d441-a1.xml" xpointer="d441-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
